kitty-file-media

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Accept kitty images sent by file path, temporary file or shared memory, as Ghostty does, so Claude Code image previews draw.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream herdr-app enables the libghostty-vt kitty file, temporary file and shared memory media.
